In article <1990Jun14.152100.15611@eagle.lerc.nasa.gov> tobritt@earth.lerc.nasa.gov writes:
>I won't give away the proper use of a credit card but I will
>tell you that rumor has is that hack dungeoneers have no use
>for credit.  So... what else is a credit card used for?
You can do 2 things with a credit card.

1. You can open locks, doors etc.

2. Rob an shop!

The last thing does not everybody know and takes some actions. The
first thing you must do is name your credit card to your own name (#name and
individual, be careful make no mistakes, you can't name a credit card twice!).

Go to an shop and pick up some things. Do #chat to the shopkeeper. The game
prints a message that you explain how a credit card works. The shopkeeper
allows you to leave the shop! BUT, after 20 moves, the shopkeeper becomes smart
and realizes that he has been cheated (what use has a credit card in a
dungeon?). He (or she of course) will try to get you, but the Keystone Kops
are not alarmed. SO, GO DIRECTLY TO THE NEXT LEVEL!

It is not without riscs, but it works fine.

